{"seq":3,"slug":"panel-data-and-fixed-effects","title":"面板数据与固定效应模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/causal-inference/panel-data-and-fixed-effects","wordCount":1852,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"面板数据与固定效应模型\">面板数据与固定效应模型</h1><p>同一批个体被反复观测——同一组城市跨十年、同一批员工跨数月——这种「实体 × 时间」的网格，是固定效应得以工作的全部前提。它的承诺很诱人：只要把每个实体自己当作自己的对照，那些恒定不变却看不见的混杂（一个城市的地理禀赋、一个人的能力天赋）就会被自动差掉，无需测量也无需建模。但 2019 年以后的一连串论文揭穿了一个被沿用了三十年的默认做法：当处理在不同时间陆续铺开、且效应随时间变化时，最常用的双向固定效应回归会给出带负权重、甚至与真实因果效应反号的估计。这一节讲清固定效应为什么有效、它在交错处理下为什么失效，以及 2021 年后的「现代 DiD」工具箱如何补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>面板数据的标准写法是给每个观测同时挂上实体下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与时间下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。单向固定效应只吸收实体维度的恒定异质性，而因果推断里几乎总是用<strong>双向固定效应（two-way fixed effects, TWFE）</strong>——同时放入实体虚拟变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与时间虚拟变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{it} = \\alpha_i + \\lambda_t + \\beta D_{it} + \\varepsilon_{it}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{it}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是处理指示（个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 期是否已受处理），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 被期望解释为处理效应。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 差掉所有不随时间变的混杂，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 差掉所有冲击全体的共同时间趋势。识别假设是<strong>平行趋势</strong>：若没有处理，处理组与对照组的结果会沿平行的轨迹演进。</p>\n<p>下图区分了固定效应模型的三种典型数据结构与它们对应的识别逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[面板数据 实体×时间网格] --&gt; B[同期处理&lt;br/&gt;所有处理单位同一时点开始]&#10;  A --&gt; C[交错处理&lt;br/&gt;不同单位不同时点陆续开始]&#10;  B --&gt; D[经典 2x2 DiD&lt;br/&gt;TWFE 无偏]&#10;  C --&gt; E[TWFE 退化为&lt;br/&gt;2x2 DiD 的加权和]&#10;  E --&gt; F[权重可为负&lt;br/&gt;已处理单位被当对照]&#10;  F --&gt; G[改用 Callaway-SantAnna&lt;br/&gt;或 ETWFE 等现代估计量]\">graph TD\n  A[面板数据 实体×时间网格] --&gt; B[同期处理&lt;br/&gt;所有处理单位同一时点开始]\n  A --&gt; C[交错处理&lt;br/&gt;不同单位不同时点陆续开始]\n  B --&gt; D[经典 2x2 DiD&lt;br/&gt;TWFE 无偏]\n  C --&gt; E[TWFE 退化为&lt;br/&gt;2x2 DiD 的加权和]\n  E --&gt; F[权重可为负&lt;br/&gt;已处理单位被当对照]\n  F --&gt; G[改用 Callaway-SantAnna&lt;br/&gt;或 ETWFE 等现代估计量]</pre><p>当且仅当处理「同期」发生（所有受处理单位在同一时点开始），TWFE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 才严格等于经典两组两期 DiD。一旦处理时点交错，等价关系破裂——这是整节的转折点。下表对比经典设定与交错设定下 TWFE 的行为差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>同期处理</th>\n<th>交错处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TWFE 是否等于干净 DiD</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否，等于 2x2 DiD 加权和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重符号</td>\n<td>全为正</td>\n<td>可能为负</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照组</td>\n<td>始终未处理单位</td>\n<td>含「已处理早期单位」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效应异质性容忍度</td>\n<td>不要求同质</td>\n<td>同质方有效，异质即偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐估计量</td>\n<td>TWFE 可用</td>\n<td>现代 DiD（见后文）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"负权重问题为什么发生\">负权重问题为什么发生</h2><p>de Chaisemartin 与 D&#39;Haultfœuille（2020，<em>American Economic Review</em>）以及 Goodman-Bacon（2021，<em>Journal of Econometrics</em>）独立证明了同一件事：在交错处理下，TWFE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是大量「2×2 DiD 子比较」的加权平均，而部分权重为负（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08807\">de Chaisemartin &amp; D&#39;Haultfœuille 工作论文</a>；<a href=\"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w29691/w29691.pdf\">NBER w29691</a>）。</p>\n<p>负权重的来源是**「坏对照」**：当算法用一个早已受处理的单位去给一个晚受处理的单位当对照时，被减掉的不是干净的反事实趋势，而是早处理单位自身仍在变化的处理效应。当处理效应随时间增长，这个错误的减法会把正的真实效应拉成负数。Goodman-Bacon 把整个 TWFE 估计量精确拆解为三类比较：未处理 vs 早处理、早处理 vs 晚处理、以及致命的「晚处理 vs 早处理（用早处理当对照）」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2112.04565\">Goodman-Bacon 分解综述</a>）。</p>\n<p>后果可以很极端：<strong>即便每个单位的真实处理效应都为正，TWFE 也可能给出负的总估计</strong>。这不是抽样噪声，而是估计量本身的系统性缺陷。Borusyak、Jaravel、Abraham 与 Sun 等也从事件研究（event-study）角度发现了对应的「污染」问题——动态系数会混入其他相对时期的效应；事件研究展开与各新一代估计量的逐期诊断详见 <a href=\"difference-in-differences\">双重差分与事件研究</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诊断工具-goodman-bacon-分解\">诊断工具:Goodman-Bacon 分解</h2><p>在换估计量之前，先要知道自己的数据里负权重有多严重。Goodman-Bacon 分解把 TWFE 系数展开为各类 2×2 比较及其权重，让你直接看到「坏比较」占了多大份额。</p>\n<p>软件层面 2026 年的成熟选择很明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>R</strong>：<code>bacondecomp</code> 包的 <code>bacon()</code> 函数（<a href=\"https://asjadnaqvi.github.io/DiD/docs/code_r/06_bacon_r/\">asjadnaqvi DiD 教程</a>）；固定效应回归本身用 <code>fixest</code>（CRAN 上 2025 年已到 0.13.x 系列）。</li>\n<li><strong>Stata</strong>：官方推荐 <code>bacondecomp</code>（<code>ssc install bacondecomp</code>），旧的 <code>ddtiming</code> 已不再活跃维护（<a href=\"https://github.com/tgoldring/ddtiming\">ddtiming 仓库</a>；<a href=\"https://github.com/Mixtape-Sessions/Advanced-DID\">Mixtape Advanced-DID 练习</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>诊断的判定逻辑是：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[跑 Goodman-Bacon 分解] --&gt; B{是否存在&lt;br/&gt;晚vs早 比较}&#10;  B --&gt;|否,纯同期处理| C[TWFE 可信&lt;br/&gt;照常报告]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{坏比较权重&lt;br/&gt;是否可观}&#10;  D --&gt;|权重很小| E[TWFE 偏差有限&lt;br/&gt;仍建议稳健性检验]&#10;  D --&gt;|权重显著| F[弃用裸 TWFE&lt;br/&gt;换现代 DiD 估计量]\">flowchart TD\n  A[跑 Goodman-Bacon 分解] --&gt; B{是否存在&lt;br/&gt;晚vs早 比较}\n  B --&gt;|否,纯同期处理| C[TWFE 可信&lt;br/&gt;照常报告]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{坏比较权重&lt;br/&gt;是否可观}\n  D --&gt;|权重很小| E[TWFE 偏差有限&lt;br/&gt;仍建议稳健性检验]\n  D --&gt;|权重显著| F[弃用裸 TWFE&lt;br/&gt;换现代 DiD 估计量]</pre><p>de Chaisemartin 与 D&#39;Haultfœuille 还提供了 <code>twowayfeweights</code> 来直接计算并汇报负权重的个数与总和——若负权重之和相对于正权重不可忽略，就是切换估计量的硬信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代估计量-callaway-sant-anna-与-etwfe\">现代估计量:Callaway-Sant&#39;Anna 与 ETWFE</h2><p>补救的共同思路是<strong>只用「干净」的比较</strong>：把已处理单位排除出对照集，只拿从未处理（或尚未处理）的单位当反事实。两条主流路线在 2026 年的应用工作中并存。</p>\n<p>**Callaway 与 Sant&#39;Anna（2021，<em>Journal of Econometrics</em>）**的做法是先对每个「处理队列 × 日历时间」估出一个组别处理效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATT(g,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是该单位首次受处理的时期），再按需求把这些干净的积木聚合成总体 ATT 或事件研究曲线。它天然容纳处理效应异质性，对照组可选「从未处理」或「尚未处理」。软件上 R 用 <code>did</code> 包、Stata 用 <code>csdid</code>（配合 <code>drdid</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>Wooldridge 的扩展双向固定效应（ETWFE）<strong>则走回归路线。Wooldridge（2025，<em>Empirical Economics</em> 69(5): 2545–2587）证明 TWFE 等价于一个「双向 Mundlak 回归」，并据此提出把处理状态与「队列」和「时间」指示</strong>完全交互</strong>的饱和设定（<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00181-025-02807-z\">Springer 链接</a>；<a href=\"https://grantmcdermott.com/etwfe/reference/etwfe.html\">etwfe R 包</a>）。这个 ETWFE 用一次混合 OLS 就能跑出队列-时间级效应，再聚合成总体或动态效应，并且与无预期、平行趋势下的填补（imputation）估计量等价。下表对比两条路线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Callaway-Sant&#39;Anna</th>\n<th>Wooldridge ETWFE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心机制</td>\n<td>非参组别 ATT 再聚合</td>\n<td>饱和交互的混合 OLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照组选择</td>\n<td>从未处理 / 尚未处理</td>\n<td>隐式由交互项决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协变量调整</td>\n<td>双稳健（含倾向得分）</td>\n<td>回归内交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主力软件</td>\n<td>R <code>did</code> / Stata <code>csdid</code></td>\n<td>R <code>etwfe</code> / 手写 OLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直觉门槛</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（就是 OLS）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>补充一句平行趋势的检验：当平行趋势可能不严格成立时，应做 <code>HonestDiD</code> 式的<strong>敏感性分析</strong>（报告「使结论翻转的临界违背幅度」）而非仅用前期系数做一次显著性检验——其相对幅度限制族、桥接 Callaway-Sant&#39;Anna 的具体流程与代码详见 <a href=\"difference-in-differences\">双重差分与事件研究</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双向固定效应靠「实体当自己的对照 + 时间虚拟变量」差掉恒定混杂，识别核心假设是平行趋势。</li>\n<li>TWFE 严格等于干净 DiD 仅在<strong>同期处理</strong>下成立；处理时点一旦交错，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 退化为一堆 2×2 DiD 的加权和。</li>\n<li>负权重源于「用已处理单位当对照」的坏比较，可导致总估计与真实效应反号——即使每个单位的真实效应都为正。</li>\n<li>动手换估计量前，先用 Goodman-Bacon 分解（R <code>bacondecomp</code>、Stata <code>bacondecomp</code>）和 <code>twowayfeweights</code> 量化坏比较的权重。</li>\n<li>现代补救有两条主线：Callaway-Sant&#39;Anna（<code>did</code> / <code>csdid</code>，非参组别 ATT 再聚合）与 Wooldridge ETWFE（<code>etwfe</code>，饱和交互 OLS，2025 年正式发表于 <em>Empirical Economics</em>）。</li>\n<li>平行趋势的稳健性用 <code>HonestDiD</code> 的敏感性分析来呈现，而非仅做前趋势显著性检验。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"面板数据与固定效应模型","id":"面板数据与固定效应模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"负权重问题为什么发生","id":"负权重问题为什么发生"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断工具:Goodman-Bacon 分解","id":"诊断工具-goodman-bacon-分解"},{"level":2,"text":"现代估计量:Callaway-Sant'Anna 与 ETWFE","id":"现代估计量-callaway-sant-anna-与-etwfe"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"断点回归设计（RDD）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/causal-inference/regression-discontinuity-design"},"next":{"title":"时间序列分析：平稳性、ARIMA 与单位根","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/timeseries-frontiers/time-series-stationarity-arima"}}